@awscloud just told people about a 10 out of 10 hole in Loom, the open source platform it ships for running AI agents.

If you stood it up with no identity provider, any client on the network could take admin of the agent control plane. Registered tool servers, reading stored credentials and rewriting the IAM roles those agents use. 

The auth fix shipped in August but the notice landed in October. 🤦‍♂️

@PhyrexNi 补一句很多人没拆开的：短端在定价「10月可不加」，长端在定价「钱仍然贵」。

AI资本开支对的是10Y/30Y，不是Fed funds。弱非农后长端冲回5.3%附近，等于告诉你：equity可以抢时间期权，折现率锚还没松。

下一枪不是叙事，是10/7–10/8的长债拍卖——拍弱，长端还会再抬一档。
